# Personal / live trading data — never commit
#
# NOTE: .gitignore only affects UNTRACKED files. Files committed before a rule
# was added stay tracked and keep getting published regardless of what is
# listed here. That is exactly what happened: 567 data/ files (including the
# real portfolio_state.json with live share quantities and entry prices) were
# committed before this rule existed and remained public until 2026-07-31.
# If you ever need to un-publish something, `git rm --cached <path>` is the
# step that actually stops it — adding it here is not enough.
#
# Verify with:  git ls-files data/ | head
data/
*.csv
*.log

# Config with real capital numbers (optional — see note below)
# config.yaml

# Broker API credentials (Kite Connect API key/secret, TOTP secret, access
# tokens) — NEVER commit. This is a collaborator's account, not the repo
# owner's; leaking these exposes someone else's live trading account.
data/secrets/
*.secret
kite_secrets.json

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# Claude Code local settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# OS
.DS_Store
